Remote Prune is an independent implementation inspired by operational review
of VS Code server cleanup. No implementation code from VS Code Bloat Cleaner
is incorporated in this release.

The statically linked executables contain the Go runtime and standard library.
Their copyright and BSD license are reproduced in GO-LICENSE.

The TypeScript runtime uses only APIs already provided by VS Code and Node.js.
Build-only npm dependencies are not included in the VSIX.
